    "title": "SelfComic: Anime Pirate Photo",
    "description": "SelfComic: Anime Pirate Photo - is an pirate anime style photo editor. This is a big gift for fans of manga, anime.\r\n\r\nDo you like to become a king of pirates, a powerful admiral of marine or one of emperors and warlords of ocean in famous Japan manga ? Right now, you ll' be yourself hero by using this app to edit your normal photos. You will have legend weapons in your photo ... You can try hair, eyes, clothes of your favorite pirates, eat fruits of devil, awake power to win your enemies and rule the sea. You can change your eye and hair color and make yourself style.\r\n\r\nAnime emoji collection will make your photo become unique and humorous.\r\n\r\nYou will be a  legend pirate with this application.\r\n\r\nFEATURE:\r\n\r\n\u2714 Create Wanted poster for yourself\r\n\u2714 Collection of anime pirate hair, clothes, items...\r\n\u2714 Collection of fruits of devil\r\n\u2714 Collection of pirate weapons : katana , spear\r\n\u2714 Collection of effect: lightning, fire, aura ...\r\n\u2714 Collection of manga frames and overlays.\r\n\u2714 Cut, rotate, flip, ... photo.\r\n\u2714 Put text into your photo.\r\n\u2714 Use brush to change color of your hair, clothes....\r\n\u2714 Upload a photo from photo gallery, camera, etc\r\n\u2714 Filter effects for your photo.\r\n\u2714 Save photos to gallery.\r\n\u2714 Share your photos via Facebook, Instagram or other social networks.\r\n\r\n-------------------\r\nAll rights to this app, images inside this app belong GameSmileStudio.\r\n\u00a9 2022 GameSmileStudio. All Rights Reserved.",
